# Deferred, markup

- A link whose label is partly formatted serializes as several links:
  `[*partly* italic](url)` comes out as `*[partly](url)*[ italic](url)`. It
  parses back to one link, so the Editor is unaffected, but an LLM reading the
  Markdown sees two links to the same place. Serialize the link mark around its
  whole run with the inner marks inside the brackets
  (`src/markdown/marks/link.ts` and the mark nesting in the serializer).
